          "id": "choice-b",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "text": "$$f ( x )=( 300 ) ( 0.85 ) 4 x$$"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choice-c",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "text": "$$f ( x )=( 300 ) ( 0.85 ) x/4$$"
